WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.617
The core contribution is Moment Unfolding,

00:00:02.697 --> 00:00:06.148
a new unbinned and non-iterative reweighting technique.

00:00:06.228 --> 00:00:10.643
It learns a reweighting function, playing the role
of a GAN generator,

00:00:10.723 --> 00:00:16.164
whose form is inspired by the Boltzmann factor so
that its trainable parameters can be

00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:19.375
directly identified with the observable's moments.

00:00:19.455 --> 00:00:24.126
A discriminator pushes the reweighted simulation to
match the target data.

00:00:24.206 --> 00:00:28.878
Unlike OmniFold, which trains a fresh pair of
networks on every iteration,

00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:32.730
Moment Unfolding trains a single pair of networks
just once.
